# Dashboard App (`apps/dashboard`)

## Structure

```
src/
  app/login/            owner Spotify sign-in
  app/(dashboard)/      signed-in shell, one folder per screen from docs/ui.md
  components/auth/      sign-in button
  components/layout/    providers
  components/shared/    page header, empty / error / loading states
  shared/api/           oRPC client (orpc.tsx), server client, session, query keys, auth client
  lib/                  env, site url, utils
```

## Rules

- Server state through TanStack Query + oRPC (`orpc.<route>.queryOptions()`), keys in `shared/api/query-keys.ts`
- Session checks happen in `(dashboard)/layout.tsx` via `getServerSession()`, there is no proxy gate (single owner)
- UI follows `docs/ui.md` (D-015): tables over cards, 13px base, monospace for data, `h-9` headers, no rounded corners, color only for status
